  {
   "name": "Raise Dead (3/day)",
   "type": "spell",
   "img": "systems/arneyan/assets/icons/spell-death-skull.svg",
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>Touch; casting takes <strong>1 minute</strong>.</p><ul><li>One willing dead creature, dead no longer than <strong>1 day per level</strong>, whose body is intact (head and torso present).</li><li>It returns with <strong>1 HP</strong>, 4 levels of Exhaustion, no spells prepared, and permanently loses 1 Constitution (minimum 3).</li><li>This loss is not drain: only Wish or Miracle can restore it.</li><li>Fails if the creature died of old age, is undead, or was destroyed by Disintegrate. No save.</li><li>Material: diamond dust worth 500 gp, consumed.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Necromancer</p>",
